'''Wormholes''' are temporary rings on the {{zone|Lotus Atoll}} and {{zone|Crimson Isle}} that appear in various locations above water or lava. They can only be seen while wearing {{Item|Froggles}}, {{Item|Silver Froggles}}, {{Item|Golden Froggles}}, or {{Item|Diamond Froggles}}.

== Location ==
'''Wormholes''' spawn on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} and {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

{{Collapsible Section Button|Show/Hide Lotus Atoll Wormhole Locations|id=atoll-locations}}

{{Collapsible Section|{{:Wormhole/Locations}}|id=atoll-locations}}

== Usage ==
Fishing inside a '''Wormhole''' allows the player to catch {{Item|Reality Hopper}} [[Trophy Frogs]] while on the {{zone|Lotus Atoll}} and also prevents [[Sea Creatures]] from being caught. Only {{Green|2}} '''Wormholes''' can exist on the {{zone|Lotus Atoll}} at once. After {{Green|4}}-{{Green|6}} catches, a '''Wormhole''' vanishes and reappears somewhere else with the following message:
{{Dialogue|&5Your &dWormhole &5closed up...}}

Additionally, some items gain bonuses from fishing inside a '''Wormhole'''.

